 <div class="kw-watch-insight-panel"><div class="kw-watch-insight-panel-title">用户活动分布</div><div class="kw-watch-insight-panel-desc">点击柱子查看该范围内的具体评论或 K 线标注。行业按评论与标注合并统计，日期按发生时间统计。</div><div class="kw-watch-activity-tabs" style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:12px"><button class="btn-outline active" type="button" style="padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px" onclick="switchWorkbenchActivityTab('sector')">行业板块</button><button class="btn-outline" type="button" style="padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px" onclick="switchWorkbenchActivityTab('date')">日期趋势</button></div><div id="kw-watchlist-activity-sector" style="width:100%;height:280px;margin-top:10px"></div><div id="kw-watchlist-activity-date" style="width:100%;height:280px;margin-top:10px;display:none"></div></div>
 </div>
 <div class="kw-watch-insight-side">
