 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-title">2. 异动情况（异动点标注）</div>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-bullet-list">
 ${anomalyPoints.length ? anomalyPoints.map((entry) => `
 <div class="kw-knowledge-bullet-item">
 <strong>${escapeHtml(entry.date || '--')}</strong>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-copy">异动点：${escapeHtml(entry.label || '异动')}</div>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-copy">指标值：${escapeHtml(entry.value || '--')}</div>
 </div>
 `).join('') : '<div class="kw-knowledge-bullet-item">当前没有关联异动报告。</div>'}
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-card">
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-title">3. 数据口径</div>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-note">当前详情页只展示纯数据分析视图，不做结果原因分析。可见范围包括趋势线、趋势状态和异动点标注。</div>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-note">当前值代表最新观测结果；历史趋势压缩展示最近时间点，用于快速判断指标方向与波动节奏。</div>
 <div class="kw-watch-chip-row" style="margin-top:12px">
 <span class="kw-watch-chip">状态：${escapeHtml(kwIndicatorStatusLabel(item.status))}</span>
 <span class="kw-watch-chip">监测源：${escapeHtml(item.owner || '--')}</span>
 <span class="kw-watch-chip">数据来源：${escapeHtml(item.data_mode_label || '--')}</span>
 <span class="kw-watch-chip">记录数：${trendSummary.length}</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-card">
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-title">4. 趋势情况与历史趋势</div>
 <div class="kw-detail-summary">
 <div class="kw-detail-stat">
 <div>
 <div class="kw-detail-stat-label">当前值</div>
 <div class="${valueClass}">${escapeHtml(currentValue)}</div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="kw-detail-stat">
 <div class="kw-detail-stat-label">当前状态</div>
 <div class="kw-detail-stat-badge">${kwIndicatorStatusBadge(item.status)}</div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="kw-detail-section-note">
 <div class="kw-detail-section-title">历史趋势</div>
 <div class="kw-detail-section-copy">展示最近 ${trendSummary.length} 个观测点，改为细长条以减少空间占用并保留趋势判断。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="kw-detail-history-list">
 ${trendSummary.map((entry) => `
 <div class="kw-detail-history-row">
 <div class="kw-detail-history-date">${escapeHtml(entry.date)}</div>
 <div class="kw-detail-history-text">指标值 ${escapeHtml(entry.value)} · ${escapeHtml(entry.direction)} · 变动 ${entry.delta > 0 ? '+' : ''}${entry.delta}</div>
 ${kwIndicatorStatusBadge(entry.status)}
 </div>
 `).join('') || '<div class="kw-knowledge-bullet-item">暂无趋势记录。</div>'}
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-card">
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-title">工作台动作</div>
 <div class="kw-knowledge-detail-note">这里可以看、分析和追踪异动，但关闭指标仍由 Admin 统一控制，避免前后台口径不一致。</div>
 <div class="kw-toolbar" style="margin-top:12px">
 <button class="btn-gold" type="button" style="padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px" onclick="showToast('已加入租户异动盯盘')">加入盯盘</button>
 <button class="btn-outline" type="button" style="padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px" onclick="showToast('已同步到洞见关注事项')">同步到洞见</button>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 `;
 modal.classList.add('show');
 if (window.GangtiseEcharts) window.GangtiseEcharts.flush(host);
}

