 <div class="charts-grid"><div class="chart-card"><div class="chart-title">验证漏斗</div><div class="chart-subtitle">租户粉丝 → 活跃粉丝 → 付费用户 → 高频用户</div><div id="kw-biz-funnel-chart" class="chart-container tall"></div></div><div class="chart-card"><div class="chart-title">渠道用户来源分布</div><div class="chart-subtitle">按粉丝导入来源统计</div><div id="kw-biz-source-pie" class="chart-container tall"></div></div></div>
