 <div data-hermes-pane="config">
 <div class="sync-grid" style="margin-bottom:20px">
 <div class="sync-card">
 <div class="sync-title">Hermes 产品口径</div>
 <div class="sync-desc">H5 现已分成两种版本：工作区版保留股票、skills、提示词和结构化结果；小金纯对话版只保留聊天和 skills，不强制单独输入股票代码。</div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap" style="margin:14px 0 4px">
 <div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">语义拦截 Skill</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">默认关闭。开启后，第一轮 LLM 意图拆解完成后，再由 Admin 配置的 Skill 调用同一默认模型判断是否命中规则；命中结果会写入审计，不再由程序关键词拦截。</div></div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="hermes-interception-skills-enabled" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap" style="margin:0 0 4px">
 <div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">Hermes 向大V开放</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 与 Web 大V账号。关闭后大V不显示 Hermes 入口，也不能发起新的 Agent 问答会话。</div></div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="hermes-dav-access-enabled" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap" style="margin:0 0 4px">
 <div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">Hermes 向普通用户开放</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 投资者账号。关闭时 Hermes 仅对大V开放，普通粉丝不会看到问答入口或历史会话。</div></div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="hermes-investor-access-enabled" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap" style="margin:0 0 4px">
 <div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">深度思考过程</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：Hermes 回答区。开启后用户可展开查看检索、图表或工具调用的处理进度；不会展示模型内部推理文本。</div></div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="hermes-thinking-process-enabled" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field" style="margin-top:10px">
 <label>默认回答风格</label>
 <select id="hermes-default-response-style">
 <option value="structured">结构化</option>
 <option value="brief">简洁</option>
 <option value="deep">深度研究</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>图表能力类型（逗号分隔）</label>
 <input id="hermes-chart-types-enabled" type="text" placeholder="kline_chart,line_chart,distribution_chart,compare_chart">
 </div>
 <div class="sync-chip-row">
 <span class="sync-chip">工作区版</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">小金纯对话版</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">skills 可选</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">skills 可自定义</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">skills 绑定知识库</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">问题里自然带股票对象时自动转个股分析</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="sync-card">
 <div class="sync-title">平台监控重点</div>
 <div class="sync-desc">平台侧看的不是按钮多少，而是这两种模式的调用量、知识命中情况、个股分析触发率和响应质量是否一致。</div>
 <div class="sync-chip-row">
 <span class="sync-chip">双版本调用占比</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">知识命中率</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">自定义 skill 使用率</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">纯对话转个股分析比率</span>
 <span class="sync-chip">响应耗时</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-grid" style="margin-bottom:20px">
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">Hermes 意图树</div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>意图树 JSON</label>
 <textarea id="hermes-intent-tree" rows="16" placeholder='[{"id":"knowledge_lookup","label":"知识问答"}]'></textarea>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">路由 / 模板树</div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>路由优先级（逗号分隔）</label>
 <textarea id="hermes-route-priority" rows="3" placeholder="session_load,memory_read,intent_router,semantic_interception,platform_tools,attachment.context,answer_synthesis"></textarea>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>模板树 JSON</label>
 <textarea id="hermes-template-tree" rows="13" placeholder='{"router":[{"id":"router.scope","label":"范围识别"}]}'></textarea>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>语义拦截 Skill 规则 JSON</label>
 <textarea id="hermes-interception-skills" rows="16" placeholder='[{"id":"no-direct-buy-sell","label":"直接交易指令","description":"识别要求买入、卖出、满仓、加仓或具体仓位指令的问题","rule_prompt":"如果用户明确要求买卖、满仓、加仓、减仓或具体仓位，请判定命中","action":"block","user_message":"我可以提供基本面、行情和风险分析，但不直接给出买卖或仓位指令。","enabled":true,"priority":10,"version":"1"}]'></textarea>
 <div class="feature-note" style="margin-top:8px">规则是可版本化的 Skill 配置，不是程序关键词名单。开关关闭时不调用额外的拦截 LLM；开启后由当前 Admin 默认模型判断，每条规则的命中、版本、动作和理由都可在“拦截审计”查看。</div>
 </div>
 <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:12px">
