 <section class="admin-settings-panel" data-settings-panel="feature-flags">
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-head">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-kicker">Access</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-title">功能开关</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-desc">平台级模块开关、数据库目标和系统入口统一在这里控制。修改后保存即可同步到 Admin、大V 工作台和 H5。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-note">这里控制的是“看不看得到”和“能不能用”，不处理具体内容生产参数。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-grid">
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">首发功能开关</div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap">
 <div class="toggle-label">
 <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-main);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">Staging 数据库</div>
 <div id="db-runtime-summary" class="feature-note" style="margin-top:0">
 关闭时默认连接本地 Postgres（开发环境），打开后连接 staging Postgres。
 </div>
 </div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="db-runtime-use-staging" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">用户模块</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：Admin 用户管理、大V工作台的粉丝管理。控制用户列表、导入、新增、标签与付费用户标注入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-user_module" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">大V租户模块</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：Admin 大V租户管理。控制大V租户配置、租户列表和协同管理入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-kol_module" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">租户门户</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：公开租户门户 /tenant/&lt;租户标识&gt;，以及大V工作台的门户 CMS 编排与预览入口。关闭后门户链接、页面和 CMS 保存接口均不可见或不可访问；H5 的基本面、复盘与租户 Dashboard 不受影响。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-tenant_portal" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">基本面分析</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 基本面页和大V工作台基本面看板。控制新闻聚合、综合归纳要闻与基本面研究入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-fundamental_analysis" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">自选股</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 自选股、大V工作台自选股详情。控制标的查询、K线、指标、标注、观察记录及详情页入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-watchlist" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">股票 K 线预测</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：自选股预测能力和大V工作台预测模型页。控制预测结果展示及预测工作流配置入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-stock_forecast" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">每日洞见</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 洞见、大V工作台洞见发布台和已发布洞见。控制洞见输入、优化成稿、摘要与发布浏览。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-daily_review" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">核心指标</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">封存开关。关闭后隐藏 H5 核心指标面板、大V智能 Dashboard 与智能指标入口；热门行业和市场一览不受影响。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-core_indicators" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">知识专区</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5、大V工作台和 Admin 知识专区。当前因知识库重构暂不开放；重新勾选并保存后，才会恢复知识入口和接口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-knowledge" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">洞见语音供稿</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 与大V工作台洞见供稿方式。当前关闭，恢复后才允许录音和语音转写。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-review_voice_input" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">洞见网页供稿</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 与大V工作台洞见供稿方式。当前关闭，恢复后才允许抓取网页 URL。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-review_url_input" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">社区</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 社区与 Admin 社区运营页。控制社区内容流、活动和互动运营相关入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-community" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">Hermes</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 Hermes 问答、大V工作台 Hermes 管理和 Admin Hermes 运营区。关闭后不展示问答、会话、记忆及使用统计入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-hermes" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">渠道模块</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：Admin 渠道运营与渠道数据页。控制渠道来源、投放归因和渠道运营配置入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-channel_module" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">数据分析模块</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：Admin 指标专区和大V工作台指标看板。控制指标总览、智能指标、数据湖、异常检测及指标定义入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-analytics_module" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">系统模块</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：Admin 系统专区。控制主题、品牌、功能开关、访问策略、模型配置、任务中心和审计等系统级配置入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-system_module" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">H5 防截图水印</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 登录后的全部页面。开启后按当前用户名和日期生成低透明度、稀疏排列的 45 度水印，降低截图外传风险；关闭后不展示。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-h5_watermark" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">会员页</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 会员权益、积分与用户分层相关页面。关闭后普通用户不再看到会员权益和积分入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-vip" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">消息/私信</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 消息页与大V粉丝会话。控制粉丝与所属大V的私信会话、系统消息和消息通知入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-dm" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">粉丝与大V互动</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 消息与自选股互动场景。控制粉丝对所属大V发起互动、反馈与回复的能力。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-fan_interaction" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">自选股粉丝互评</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：自选股详情评论区。开启后粉丝可查看其他粉丝评论；关闭后粉丝只能看到大V评论和自己的评论，大V仍可查看租户全部评论。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-watchlist_fan_comment_interaction" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap">
 <div class="toggle-label">
 <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-main);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">微信环境受限测试</div>
 <div class="feature-note" style="margin-top:0">
 只作为后台测试开关存在。关闭后，H5 前台不展示任何普通浏览器 / 微信模拟 / 严格受限入口，同时忽略 <code>wx_env</code> 测试参数。
 </div>
 </div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="auth-wechat-runtime-test-enabled" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">付费回复</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：消息/私信的商业化回复场景。控制需要付费或权益校验后才可发起的回复能力，不影响已开放的普通消息浏览。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-paid_reply" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">粉丝订阅与收款</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">开启后，租户可配置订阅产品、创建待支付订单并按真实到账状态开通权益。未配置支付渠道时不会伪造支付成功。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-fan_commerce" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">粉丝扫码导入</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">开启后，大V可生成租户专属二维码。粉丝扫码登录或注册后自动归属当前租户，并记录来源和批次。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-fan_qr_import" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap"><div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">大V 工作台 Web</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：Web 端大V工作台及租户经营页面。控制工作台、数据分析、粉丝管理和洞见生产台入口。</div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="feature-workbench" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
 <div class="feature-note">平台统一使用用户表中的用户名和密码登录，不再使用共享访问密码或“系统锁定”门禁。账号状态由用户管理维护。</div>
 <div class="feature-note" style="margin-top:8px">MVP 默认优先开放：基本面、自选股、复盘、消息互动、知识归档、大V工作台和租户门户；预测分析放到第二阶段，会员收费能力按层级逐步开放。</div>
 <div class="feature-note" style="margin-top:8px">Hermes 范围约束开启后，只接受固定研究范围内的提示词；关闭后，Hermes 会按更开放的问答模式继续承接。普通用户开放开关关闭时，H5 中只有大V用户能看到和使用 Hermes。</div>
 <div class="feature-note" style="margin-top:8px">“自选股粉丝互评”关闭后，普通用户在自选股评论区只会看到大V评论和自己的评论；大V仍可查看租户内全部评论。</div>
 <div style="display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:16px">
 <button class="btn-gold" type="button" style="padding:10px 20px;font-size:13px;width:100%" onclick="saveSiteConfig()">保存功能开关</button>
 <div class="feature-note" id="feature-config-status">修改开关后需要点击保存才会生效。保存后，Admin、大V工作台和 H5 会按最新配置同步显示或隐藏对应功能。</div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="admin-settings-panel" data-settings-panel="login-access">
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-head">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-kicker">Access</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-title">登录与访问策略</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-desc">登录方式、微信受限测试、平台发布口径和租户隔离策略统一收口在这里，避免访问规则散落在多个页面。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-note">系统登录策略和发布边界属于平台级规则，不建议放进业务页面里临时修改。</div>
 </div>
 <div id="settings-panel-login-access" class="admin-settings-mount"></div>
 </section>

 <section class="admin-settings-panel" data-settings-panel="market-data">
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-head">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-kicker">Market Data</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-title">Gangtise OpenAPI 凭证</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-desc">Access Key、Secret Key 和 Long Token 明文保存到当前 PostgreSQL 的 <code>app_settings</code>，以便本地、staging 和 production 做完整数据库复制。任何凭证都不会回显到浏览器或写入日志。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-note">切换本地 / staging 数据库时，本页显示并保存对应数据库自己的凭证。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-grid">
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">连接配置</div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>OpenAPI 地址</label>
 <input id="gangtise-credential-base-url" type="url" placeholder="https://openapi.gangtise.com" autocomplete="off">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>Access Key</label>
 <input id="gangtise-credential-access-key" type="password" placeholder="未配置；填写后保存" autocomplete="new-password">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>Secret Key</label>
 <input id="gangtise-credential-secret-key" type="password" placeholder="未配置；填写后保存" autocomplete="new-password">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>Long Token（可选）</label>
 <input id="gangtise-credential-long-token" type="password" placeholder="可作为 Access Key / Secret Key 的备用认证" autocomplete="new-password">
 </div>
 <div class="feature-note">已配置的密钥不会回显。留空即保持当前值不变；推荐使用 Access Key + Secret Key，由系统自动换取短期 Token。凭证记录与数据库一起复制，不依赖各环境的应用密钥。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">运行状态与校验</div>
 <div id="gangtise-credential-status" class="feature-note">正在读取当前数据库中的凭证状态...</div>
 <div class="config-field" style="margin-top:14px">
 <label>校验标的</label>
 <input id="gangtise-credential-probe-code" type="text" value="601988.SH" maxlength="32" placeholder="例如 601988.SH" autocomplete="off">
 </div>
 <div style="display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:14px">
 <button id="gangtise-credential-save" class="btn-gold" type="button" style="padding:10px 20px;font-size:13px;width:100%" onclick="saveGangtiseCredentials()">保存凭证</button>
 <button id="gangtise-credential-diagnose" class="btn-outline" type="button" style="padding:10px 20px;font-size:13px;width:100%" onclick="diagnoseGangtiseCredentials()">保存后校验真实日 K</button>
 </div>
 <div id="gangtise-credential-diagnostic" class="feature-note" style="margin-top:12px">校验会调用 Gangtise 的真实日 K 接口，仅返回 HTTP 状态、耗时、数据点数和最新交易日。</div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="admin-settings-panel" data-settings-panel="knowledge-source">
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-head">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-kicker">Knowledge</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-title">知识输入源</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-desc">统一配置知识资料如何进入系统，包括语音转写、向量生成和前台是否允许查看文件 / URL 解析预览。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-note">知识治理页只负责查看知识入库、修改、清洗与同步链路；具体系统配置在这里维护。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-grid">
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">租户研究资料输入源</div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>支持渠道</label>
 <input type="text" value="大V语音输入 / 文件上传 / 网页URL" readonly>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>资料用途</label>
 <input type="text" value="形成租户研究资料底座，并同步到基本面、洞见、Hermes 与工作台研究记录" readonly>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>语音转写引擎</label>
 <select id="voice-transcription-engine">
 <option value="local">本地 Python 转写（默认）</option>
 <option value="api">大模型 API 转写</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>API 转写模型名</label>
 <input id="voice-transcription-api-model" type="text" placeholder="例如 whisper-1">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>API 转写语言</label>
 <input id="voice-transcription-api-language" type="text" placeholder="zh">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>本地转写模型</label>
 <input id="voice-transcription-local-model-size" type="text" placeholder="例如 small">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>转写后处理</label>
 <select id="voice-transcription-post-process-mode">
 <option value="rule_based">规则纠错与术语清洗（推荐）</option>
 <option value="none">仅保留原始转写</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;line-height:1.7">
 <input type="checkbox" id="voice-transcription-domain-glossary-enabled">
 <span>
 启用财经术语纠错
 <span class="feature-note" style="display:block;margin-top:4px">
 对 CPI、PE、PB、ROE、上证指数、常见股票简称与代码做规则归一；不依赖大模型，默认开启。
 </span>
 </span>
 </label>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>向量生成引擎</label>
 <select id="voice-embedding-engine">
 <option value="local">本地 Embedding</option>
 <option value="api">大模型 API Embedding</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>API 向量模型名</label>
 <input id="voice-embedding-api-model" type="text" placeholder="例如 text-embedding-3-small">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>本地向量模型</label>
 <input id="voice-embedding-local-model" type="text" placeholder="例如 BAAI/bge-small-zh-v1.5">
 </div>
 <div class="feature-note">
 默认链路为：语音转写 → 规则纠错 → 术语清洗。大模型整理只在前台勾选时额外启用，不影响纯 ASR 路径。
 </div>
 <div class="feature-note" style="margin-top:8px">
 转写引擎和向量引擎独立配置，可自由组合。系统会按 embedding 引擎自动隔离 vector namespace，避免不同模型生成的向量混搜。
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;line-height:1.7">
 <input type="checkbox" id="knowledge-user-preview-enabled">
 <span>
 允许前台用户查看文件 / URL 解析预览
 <span class="feature-note" style="display:block;margin-top:4px">
 默认关闭。关闭后，用户仍可上传文件、提交 URL 并异步入库，但不会看到系统抽取出的标题、摘要和解析细节；适合日常生产。只有排查解析问题时再临时打开。
 </span>
 </span>
 </label>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">保存发布</div>
 <button class="btn-gold" style="padding:10px 20px;font-size:13px;margin-top:4px;width:100%" onclick="saveSiteConfig()">保存系统配置</button>
 <div class="feature-note" id="site-config-status">
 保存后，新的知识录入请求会按当前配置生效；前台用户自己的展示偏好不会受影响。
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="admin-settings-panel" data-settings-panel="evidence-chain">
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-head">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-kicker">Knowledge</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-title">证据链配置</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-desc">证据链是 Hermes、知识问答、复盘和后续智能体的共用能力。相关性过滤、回答超时和白盒提示词统一在这里维护。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-note">这里改的是公共证据链底座，不是某一个页面的局部提示词。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-grid single-column">
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">证据链过滤配置</div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>过滤系统提示词</label>
 <textarea id="evidence-filter-system-prompt" rows="8" placeholder="系统提示词"></textarea>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>过滤用户提示词模板</label>
 <textarea id="evidence-filter-user-template" rows="10" placeholder="可使用 {query} 和 {candidate_blocks} 占位符"></textarea>
 </div>
 <div class="config-grid two-column" style="margin-top:12px">
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>过滤超时（秒）</label>
 <input id="evidence-filter-timeout-seconds" type="number" min="5" max="120" step="1" placeholder="25">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>回答超时（秒）</label>
 <input id="evidence-answer-timeout-seconds" type="number" min="5" max="180" step="1" placeholder="45">
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="feature-note">
 保存后，知识库问答、证据链 API，以及复盘、自选股研究和后续复用这套能力的入口都会使用这里的提示词和超时设置。
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="admin-settings-panel" data-settings-panel="review-flow">
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-head">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-kicker">Knowledge</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-title">洞见生成配置</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-desc">这里配置洞见的生成链路：先生成用户洞见，再基于用户确认内容生成摘要和发布预览。工作台和 H5 共用这一套白盒模板。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-note">洞见参数属于系统级生产配置，前台页面只消费结果，不直接暴露这些模板。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-grid single-column">
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">洞见生成白盒配置</div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>阶段1：输入润色系统提示词</label>
 <textarea id="review-polish-system-prompt" rows="8" placeholder="输入润色系统提示词"></textarea>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>阶段1：输入润色用户模板</label>
 <textarea id="review-polish-user-template" rows="9" placeholder="可使用 {period_label} / {source_mode} / {speaker_label} / {entry_point} / {source_text}"></textarea>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>阶段2：完整成稿系统提示词</label>
 <textarea id="review-compose-system-prompt" rows="8" placeholder="完整成稿系统提示词"></textarea>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>阶段2：完整成稿用户模板</label>
 <textarea id="review-compose-user-template" rows="10" placeholder="可使用 {period_label} / {speaker_label} / {entry_point} / {tag_text} / {prompt_text} / {source_text} / {dashboard_blocks} / {knowledge_blocks}"></textarea>
 </div>
 <div class="config-grid two-column" style="margin-top:12px">
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>输入润色超时（秒）</label>
 <input id="review-polish-timeout-seconds" type="number" min="5" max="180" step="1" placeholder="45">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>完整成稿超时（秒）</label>
 <input id="review-compose-timeout-seconds" type="number" min="5" max="240" step="1" placeholder="60">
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="feature-note">
 这里是洞见生成的白盒配置。工作台中的“开始优化”和后续的摘要、发布预览都会读取这里的提示词与超时设置。
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="admin-settings-panel" data-settings-panel="llm-models">
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-head">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-kicker">AI</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-title">模型配置</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-desc">统一维护平台可调用的大模型配置。默认模型、可用模型列表和 staging 同步动作都放在这里。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-note">模型配置和业务代码解耦，运营或技术可以直接切换模型，不需要改功能逻辑。</div>
 </div>
 <div id="settings-panel-llm-models" class="admin-settings-mount"></div>
 </section>

 <section class="admin-settings-panel" data-settings-panel="llm-feature-map">
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-head">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-kicker">AI</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-title">功能级模型映射</div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-desc">按功能维度绑定模型。Hermes、复盘、知识加工、评论标注等能力可以各自指向不同模型，同时保留默认模型回退。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-settings-panel-note">统一模型是默认策略；只有明确需要时，才对单功能单独切换。</div>
 </div>
 <div id="settings-panel-llm-feature-map" class="admin-settings-mount"></div>
 </section>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div><!-- end section-settings-features -->

 <div id="section-settings-policy" style="display:none">
 <div class="config-grid">
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">H5 登录策略</div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap">
 <div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">账号密码登录</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 登录页。控制用户名和密码登录表单；关闭后用户只能使用其他已开启的登录方式。</div></div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="auth-password-login-enabled" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap">
 <div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">微信登录</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：H5 登录页。控制微信 OAuth 登录入口；启用前需要完整配置 AppID、AppSecret 和回调地址。</div></div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="auth-wechat-login-enabled" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap">
 <div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">快捷选账号进入</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：本地演示和测试环境的 H5 登录页。展示已有账号的快捷入口，不应作为生产环境的正式登录方式。</div></div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="auth-quick-select-enabled" type="checkbox" checked><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>微信 AppID</label>
 <input id="auth-wechat-app-id" type="text" placeholder="wx1234567890abcdef">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>微信 AppSecret</label>
 <input id="auth-wechat-app-secret" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="已加密配置，留空不修改">
 <div id="auth-wechat-secret-status" class="feature-note" style="margin-top:6px">AppSecret 仅以密文保存到 PostgreSQL，不会回显。</div>
 <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:400">
 <input id="auth-wechat-clear-secret" type="checkbox">
 清除已保存的 AppSecret
 </label>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>微信回调地址</label>
 <input id="auth-wechat-redirect-uri" type="text" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:5001/api/h5/wechat/callback">
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>微信 Scope</label>
 <select id="auth-wechat-scope">
 <option value="snsapi_userinfo">snsapi_userinfo</option>
 <option value="snsapi_base">snsapi_base</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 <div class="toggle-wrap">
 <div class="toggle-label"><div class="feature-toggle-title">微信首次登录自动注册</div><div class="feature-toggle-desc">位置：微信 OAuth 回调。开启后首次登录的微信用户会按下方默认角色和租户自动创建平台账号。</div></div>
 <label class="toggle"><input id="auth-wechat-auto-register-enabled" type="checkbox"><span class="toggle-slider"></span></label>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>自动注册默认角色</label>
 <select id="auth-wechat-default-role">
 <option value="investor">投资者</option>
 <option value="dav">大V</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>自动注册默认租户</label>
 <select id="auth-wechat-default-tenant-slug"></select>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>自动注册默认顾问名</label>
 <input id="auth-wechat-default-advisor-name" type="text" placeholder="为空时按租户主理人回填">
 </div>
 <div class="feature-note">
 推荐策略：账号密码和微信同时开放，快捷选账号只保留给内部演示或验收环境。生产环境如果关闭快捷进入，H5 首屏将只保留正式登录方式。
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">平台发布策略</div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>当前首发范围</label>
 <input type="text" value="MVP：基本面 H5 / 复盘 / 自选股 / 消息互动 / 知识归档 / 大V门户 CMS / 大V 工作台 Web" readonly>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>策略备注</label>
 <input type="text" value="阶段二（约1个月后）再开放预测分析；收费能力按粉丝与大V层级逐步放开" readonly>
 </div>
 <div class="feature-note">
 当前一个月目标是满足 MVP：让粉丝和大V先完成消息互动、复盘分享、粉丝扫码导入与知识沉淀；预测分析和更复杂收费能力后移。
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">租户隔离策略</div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>普通投资者互动边界</label>
 <input type="text" value="仅可与所属大V投顾互动，跨租户投顾内容默认关闭" readonly>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>研究需求回流</label>
 <input type="text" value="普通投资者通过 Hermes 提交的未覆盖需求进入租户研究需求统计" readonly>
 </div>
 <div class="feature-note">
 Admin 负责统一租户隔离策略，保证前台自选股、私信、活动与工作台使用同一套权限边界。
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-card">
 <div class="config-card-title">角色能力矩阵</div>
 <div class="feature-note" style="margin-bottom:10px">
 角色是身份，能力决定可访问的产品面。新增角色或调整权限只需修改此 JSON；例如 admin 保持管理员身份，同时授予 dav、hermes 和 workbench 能力。
 </div>
 <div class="config-field">
 <label>角色能力 JSON</label>
 <textarea id="role-capabilities-json" rows="9" placeholder='{"admin":["admin","h5","dav","hermes","workbench"]}'></textarea>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div><!-- end section-settings-policy -->

 <div id="section-knowledge-overview" style="display:none">
 <div class="admin-knowledge-entry-card">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-entry-title">知识专区</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-entry-desc">知识能力已拆成独立页面：总览只看规模和结构，知识治理只看知识入库、修改与同步链路，百科只看人能读懂的词条详情，图谱只看关系网络。</div>
 </div>
 <span class="tag tag-blue">Knowledge</span>
 </div>
 <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px">
 <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap">
 <div>
 <div class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:6px">总览视角</div>
 <div class="feature-note">Admin 可以先看平台全局，也可以切到单租户，确认知识沉淀规模和成熟度。</div>
 </div>
 <div class="config-field" style="min-width:240px;margin:0">
 <label>租户筛选</label>
 <select data-admin-knowledge-tenant-filter></select>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-grid">
 <button class="admin-knowledge-hub-card" type="button" onclick="showSection('knowledge-intake', document.querySelector('.admin-nav-item[data-section=&quot;knowledge-intake&quot;]'))">
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-title">知识治理</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-desc">查看语音、文件、网页和手动录入进入知识库的全过程，追溯原始内容、同步状态与入库结果。</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-meta">进入知识治理</div>
 </button>
 <button class="admin-knowledge-hub-card" type="button" onclick="showSection('knowledge-encyclopedia', document.querySelector('.admin-nav-item[data-section=&quot;knowledge-encyclopedia&quot;]'))">
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-title">百科结构</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-desc">先看知识规模、成熟度、来源分布和高频主题，判断知识库是否已经长成稳定结构。</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-meta">进入百科结构</div>
 </button>
 <button class="admin-knowledge-hub-card" type="button" onclick="showSection('knowledge-entries', document.querySelector('.admin-nav-item[data-section=&quot;knowledge-entries&quot;]'))">
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-title">百科词条</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-desc">只看人能读懂的词条列表，直接打开摘要、要点、验证节点和正文详情。</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-meta">进入词条列表</div>
 </button>
 <button class="admin-knowledge-hub-card" type="button" onclick="showSection('knowledge-graph', document.querySelector('.admin-nav-item[data-section=&quot;knowledge-graph&quot;]'))">
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-title">知识图谱</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-desc">只看知识对象之间的主题、实体、方法、观点和验证信号关系，不把上传素材当作图谱节点。</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-hub-meta">进入知识图谱</div>
 </button>
 </div>
 <div id="admin-knowledge-overview-summary" class="admin-knowledge-overview-grid"></div>
 </div><!-- end section-knowledge-overview -->

 <div id="section-knowledge-intake" style="display:none">
 <div class="admin-knowledge-entry-card">
 <div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-entry-title">知识治理</div>
 <div class="admin-knowledge-entry-desc">这里专门负责知识进入系统前后的一整条治理链路。统一查看原始输入、人工修改、解析结果、同步状态和治理配置，不和百科浏览或图谱浏览混在同一页。</div>
 </div>
 <button class="btn-gold" style="padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px" type="button" onclick="showSection('knowledge-graph', document.querySelector('.admin-nav-item[data-section=&quot;knowledge-graph&quot;]'))">进入知识图谱</button>
 </div>
 <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px">
 <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap">
 <div>
 <div class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:6px">知识原始内容总览</div>
 <div class="feature-note">这里给 Admin 直接查看用户原始输入、文件 / URL 解析正文、语音转写原文和解析元数据，确保后续给大模型生成时能追溯原材料。</div>
 </div>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap">
 <div class="config-field" style="min-width:220px;margin:0">
 <label>租户筛选</label>
 <select id="admin-knowledge-tenant-filter" data-admin-knowledge-tenant-filter></select>
 </div>
 <button class="btn-outline" style="padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px" onclick="loadAdminKnowledgeItems(true)">刷新列表</button>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="table-card" style="margin-bottom:16px">
 <table>
 <thead>
 <tr>
 <th>时间</th>
 <th>租户</th>
 <th>类型</th>
 <th>标题</th>
 <th>来源</th>
 <th>原始内容预览</th>
 <th>操作</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody id="admin-knowledge-center-items-body" data-admin-knowledge-items-body>
