 <div id="section-task-center" style="display:none">
 <div class="section-header">
 <div>
 <div class="section-title">定时任务专区</div>
 <div class="section-subtitle">统一管理所有后台定时任务，集中查看启停、下一次执行、最近状态与异常。</div>
 </div>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
 <button class="btn-outline" style="padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px" onclick="refreshAdminTaskCenter(false)">刷新任务状态</button>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="stats-grid">
 <div class="stat-card">
 <div class="stat-label">纳管任务</div>
 <span class="stat-icon">&#9201;</span>
 <div class="stat-value" id="task-center-total">0</div>
 <div class="stat-change up">统一调度</div>
 </div>
 <div class="stat-card">
 <div class="stat-label">启用中</div>
 <span class="stat-icon">&#10003;</span>
 <div class="stat-value" id="task-center-enabled">0</div>
 <div class="stat-change up">自动轮询</div>
 </div>
 <div class="stat-card">
 <div class="stat-label">运行中</div>
 <span class="stat-icon">&#9711;</span>
 <div class="stat-value" id="task-center-running">0</div>
 <div class="stat-change up">后台线程</div>
 </div>
 <div class="stat-card">
 <div class="stat-label">异常任务</div>
 <span class="stat-icon">&#9888;</span>
 <div class="stat-value" id="task-center-failed">0</div>
 <div class="stat-change" style="color:#C8A96E">需要介入</div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="table-wrap" style="margin-bottom:20px">
 <div class="table-header">
 <div>
 <div class="table-title">任务配置与状态</div>
 <div style="font-size:12px;color:#8899aa;margin-top:6px">所有重任务都从这里执行。支持 interval、daily 与 manual；每个任务都可以手工执行并查看运行记录。</div>
 </div>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
 <select id="task-center-group-filter" onchange="renderAdminTaskCenter()" style="background:#0D1B2A;border:1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.2);color:#F8F6F0;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px">
 <option value="">全部分组</option>
 <option value="indicator">indicator</option>
 <option value="knowledge">knowledge</option>
 </select>
 <select id="task-center-status-filter" onchange="renderAdminTaskCenter()" style="background:#0D1B2A;border:1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.2);color:#F8F6F0;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px">
 <option value="">全部状态</option>
 <option value="running">running</option>
 <option value="failed">failed</option>
