 <span class="stat-icon">&#128640;</span>
 <div class="stat-value" id="token-summary-24h-avg-throughput">0</div>
 <div class="stat-change up" id="token-summary-24h-output-throughput">输出 0 token/s</div>
 </div>
 <div class="stat-card">
